Welcome to <%= title %>.

This is your home page. Edit `content/index.md` to change what shows
up here. Markdown, ERB partials (with the right config), the works.

Below the markdown body, Abqari can render optional home modules —
latest post, photo gallery, featured publication, contact button, and
more. Toggle them on under `home:` in `config/site.yml`.

## Where to next

- [Read the latest posts](/posts/)
- [About](/about/)

## Customising

| Where | What |
|---|---|
| `config/site.yml` | Site identity, theme, collections, environment URLs |
| `content/index.md` | This page |
| `app/assets/css/site.css` | Your custom CSS, loaded after the theme |

When you're ready: edit `config/site.yml`, set the production `url:`,
flip on the collections and home modules you need.
